--- based on AS-C-COLL: the iterator associated with a ELIST is the enclosed LIST
view ElistAsCcoll{X :: TRIV} from AS-C-COLL to ELIST{X} is 
  sort Coll to List{X} .
  sort Elt to X$Elt .
  sort Iterable to Elist{X} .
  op iterator to list .
endv